# Mirror of .grype.yaml -- both scanners gate the weekly audit, so an
# investigated exception has to be expressed to both or the audit goes red
# on a finding that was already accepted.
#
# CVE-2026-15308: CPU-exhaustion DoS in Python's html.parser.HTMLParser.
# suricata-update -- the only thing running on this Python in this image --
# fetches and parses YAML index files and plain-text Suricata rule files over
# HTTPS, and never imports `html`/`html.parser` (zero references in the
# installed package source). The vulnerable code cannot be reached here.
# Fixed only in Python 3.15.0, which is not released stable yet (3.15.0rc1
# as of 2026-08-18) -- see SECURITY.md for the tracking entry.
CVE-2026-15308
